sequenceDiagram
  actor C as Customer
  participant A as Application
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  participant W as Durable worker
  participant P as Persistent mock provider
  actor S as Staff
  C->>A: Cart, modifiers, recipient, contact, slot, promo
  A->>D: Serializable validate and reserve quote
  D-->>C: Expiring authoritative quote
  C->>A: Accept quote + stable idempotency key
  A->>D: Revalidate; create one order, attempt, outbox
  alt quote expired or menu changed
    A-->>C: Conflict; review a fresh quote before payment
  else committed checkout
    A-->>C: Private tracking link; payment processing
    W->>D: Claim durable job with lease
    W->>P: Create/reconcile original provider order
    W->>P: Pay original order once
    alt confirmed paid
      P-->>W: Authoritative payment reference
      W->>D: Persist paid + notification/intake outbox
    else definite decline
      P-->>W: Declined
      W->>D: Failed; release capacity/promo reservation
    else charge succeeds but response is lost
      W->>D: UNKNOWN_REQUIRES_RECONCILIATION
      W->>P: Look up original attempt; never start a new charge
      P-->>W: Original authoritative result
      W->>D: Persist reconciled state
    end
    alt intake or print request fails
      W->>D: Preserve payment; retry safe job / dead-letter alert
      Note over W,S: Print acceptance is not physical print evidence
    end
    S->>A: Accept / preparing / ready / complete
    C->>A: Poll private status
    A-->>C: Separate payment and fulfillment states
  end
